From: cubie-a5e-openwrt <noreply@github.com>
Subject: sunxi: add Allwinner A527 and the Radxa Cubie A5E

Changes to files of the OpenWrt tree, taken from ImmortalWrt master
(da63f7d6ac4207e534c9b92ba3d2b555a8edce8d) with their A523/A527 parts only:

 - cortexa53: PCI/PCIe feature (M.2 NVMe), A523 clocks, pinctrl, IOMMU,
   PCIe, combo PHY, DWMAC sun55i (GMAC200), MAXIO PHY in the kernel config
 - image: sun55i-a527 SoC and the radxa_cubie-a5e device
 - board.d: eth0 LAN, eth1 WAN
 - U-Boot radxa-cubie-a5e (radxa-cubie-a5e_defconfig, uEnv-a523)
 - TF-A sun55i_a523

Not taken: ImmortalWrt's default package changes and the Orange Pi Zero
UWE5622 device packages. The device installs wpad-mbedtls instead of
ImmortalWrt's wpad-openssl.

---
diff --git a/package/boot/arm-trusted-firmware-sunxi/Makefile b/package/boot/arm-trusted-firmware-sunxi/Makefile
index 1568568..b211285 100644
--- a/package/boot/arm-trusted-firmware-sunxi/Makefile
+++ b/package/boot/arm-trusted-firmware-sunxi/Makefile
@@ -26,6 +26,11 @@ define Trusted-Firmware-A/Default
 	BUILD_SUBTARGET:=cortexa53
 endef
 
+define Trusted-Firmware-A/sunxi-a523
+	NAME:=Allwinner A523
+	PLAT:=sun55i_a523
+endef
+
 define Trusted-Firmware-A/sunxi-a64
 	NAME:=Allwinner A64
 	PLAT:=sun50i_a64
@@ -42,6 +47,7 @@ define Trusted-Firmware-A/sunxi-h616
 endef
 
 TFA_TARGETS:= \
+	sunxi-a523 \
 	sunxi-a64 \
 	sunxi-h6 \
 	sunxi-h616
diff --git a/package/boot/uboot-sunxi/Makefile b/package/boot/uboot-sunxi/Makefile
index d352ac7..e684d6f 100644
--- a/package/boot/uboot-sunxi/Makefile
+++ b/package/boot/uboot-sunxi/Makefile
@@ -439,6 +439,15 @@ define U-Boot/rongpin_rp_t113
   UENV:=t113.ttyS3
 endef
 
+define U-Boot/radxa-cubie-a5e
